我已经做完了，需求都没确定客户没付钱，就说做完了。<br /><br />我是真的无语了，给你联调，一堆问题得你来测，也不提前沟通怎么做，做好了让你自己去看接口参数。<br /><br />现在技术层面的也没人可以反馈，真的是折磨。", "last_modified": 1790226784, "replies": 44, "id": 1244514}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/df0a/ab05/1148_large.png?m=1751736790", "name": "claude", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/df0a/ab05/1148_normal.png?m=1751736790", "title": "Claude", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/claude", "topics": 938, "footer": "", "header": "", "title_alternative": "Claude", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/df0a/ab05/1148_mini.png?m=1751736790", "stars": 719, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 1148, "parent_node_name": "geek"}, "member": {"id": 95559, "username": "jiehuangwei", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/jiehuangwei", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/fb49/74ac/95559_mini.png?m=1438585139", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/fb49/74ac/95559_normal.png?m=1438585139", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/fb49/74ac/95559_large.png?m=1438585139", "created": 1422955888, "last_modified": 1438585139, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "dcvsiug", "last_touched": 1790266251, "title": "Your account has been suspended", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1244469", "created": 1790217648, "deleted": 0, "content": "claude 账号终于炸了\r\n\r\n从 3 月份用到现在，gmail 注册的\r\n\r\n早上一开电脑才发现。\r\n一时之间，竟不知道该干啥了。\r\n\r\n大家有什么好的替代方案，可以推荐下\r\n\r\nHello,\r\n\r\nOur automated systems detected signals associated with your account which indicate violation of our Supported Countries Policy. These signals were, in turn, reviewed by our team to validate our system's findings. As a result, we have revoked your access to Claude.\r\n\r\nTo appeal our decision, log in to claude.ai with this account and you'll be taken to the appeals page. You can learn more about the process here.\r\n\r\nRegards\r\n\r\nAnthropic's Safeguards Team", "content_rendered": "<p>claude 账号终于炸了</p>\n<p>从 3 月份用到现在，gmail 注册的</p>\n<p>早上一开电脑才发现。\n一时之间，竟不知道该干啥了。</p>\n<p>大家有什么好的替代方案，可以推荐下</p>\n<p>Hello,</p>\n<p>Our automated systems detected signals associated with your account which indicate violation of our Supported Countries Policy. These signals were, in turn, reviewed by our team to validate our system's findings. As a result, we have revoked your access to Claude.</p>\n<p>To appeal our decision, log in to <a href=\"http://claude.ai\" rel=\"nofollow\">claude.ai</a> with this account and you'll be taken to the appeals page. You can learn more about the process here.</p>\n<p>Regards</p>\n<p>Anthropic's Safeguards Team</p>\n", "last_modified": 1790217648, "replies": 41, "id": 1244469}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/df0a/ab05/1148_large.png?m=1751736790", "name": "claude", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/df0a/ab05/1148_normal.png?m=1751736790", "title": "Claude", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/claude", "topics": 938, "footer": "", "header": "", "title_alternative": "Claude", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/df0a/ab05/1148_mini.png?m=1751736790", "stars": 719, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 1148, "parent_node_name": "geek"}, "member": {"id": 215985, "username": "blackantt", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/blackantt", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/003f1b50994eb31aeb26105920380e3a?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/003f1b50994eb31aeb26105920380e3a?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/003f1b50994eb31aeb26105920380e3a?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1487442392, "last_modified": 1487442392, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "Integ", "last_touched": 1790254290, "title": "到底应该用 astra 还是 opus 5.5 来写代码呢？", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1244518", "created"